$ 2. kill the app with the queue unsent

$ adb_ shell am force-stop dev.undra.playground
process gone

$ 3. real airplane mode on, relaunch: the persisted query answers from Kv, the persisted queue is held

$ adb_ shell cmd connectivity airplane-mode enable
